  "text": "\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\nElections - Jasper County, Iowa\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \n \n \n\n Jasper County\n \nElections\n \n \n\n That this nation, under GOD, shall have a\n\n new birth of freedom - and that\n\n government of the People, by the People\n\n for the People, shall not perish from the earth.\n \nAbraham Lincoln\n \n \n\n \n\n Facebook Contact Us\n \n \n\n \n \nHome\n \nVote\n \n \nRegister to Vote\n \nAbsentee Voting\n \nMaps\n \nMilitary/Overseas Voting\n \nPrecincts\n \nVoter ID\n \n \n \nElections\n \n \nUpcoming Elections\n \nPast Elections\n \nSample Ballots\n \nPrecinct Election Officials\n \nTypes of Elections\n \n \n \nElected Officials\n \n \nFederal\n \nState\n \nCounty\n \nCity\n \nSchool Board\n \nTownship\n \n \n \nCandidates\n \nNews\n \nFAQ\n \n \n \n\n\n\n\n Jasper County\nElections\n\n\n\n November 3rd General Election Important Dates | In person absentee voting happening now! \n\n\n\n\n \n\n \n\n \nWelcome to the Jasper County Elections Website.\n The Auditor’s Office is responsible for every aspect of conducting an election from voter registration to the final count of the votes. This site is designed to be a resource for residents looking to learn how to vote, find their elected officials, learn about becoming a candidate, or find past or upcoming election information.\n \n \n\n \n\n Auditor & Comissioner of Elections\n\n Jenna Jennings \n\n \n\n Call Us (641) 792-7016\n \n \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n \nQuick Links\n \nElection Results\n \nElected Officials\n \nAm I Registered?\n \nRegister to Vote\n \nHow Do I Vote?\n \nWhere Do I Vote?\n \n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n \nUpcoming & Recent Elections\n \n\n \n\n \nNov\n \n3\n \n \n\n General Election 2026\n General Election\n \n\n Election Information Sample Ballot(s)\n Candidate List\n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \nJun\n \n2\n \n \n\n Primary Election | June 2, 2026\n Primary Election\n \n\n Unofficial Results\n More Results\n Sample Ballot(s)\n Candidate List\n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n \nFeb\n \n17\n \n \n\n Mitchellville City Council Special Election\n Special Election\n \n\n \n \n \n \n\n \n\n\n\n\n \n\n News\n \n\n Jasper County, Iowa | Past Elections\n \n June 20, 2022 Jasper County, Iowa | Past Elections \n\n\n\n\n Jasper County June 2022 Primary\n\n\nAll News\n \n \n\n \n FAQ\n \n\n \nQ.\n \n\nCan I use power of attorney to request a ballot for my spouse, child or parent?\n \n\n \n \n\n \nA.\n \n\nNo. Under Iowa law, power of attorney does not apply for all election related matters. \n\n \n\n \n \n\n \nQ.\n \n\nWhat do I need to bring with me to vote?\n \n\n \n \n\n \nA.\n \n\nStarting in January of 2019 you will be required to show identification. If you need to register to vote on Election Day, you must bring proof of identification and proof of residency. \n\n \n\n \n \nAll Frequently Asked Questions\n \n \n\n \n Jasper County Voter Registration\n \n\n Updated September 3, 2026\n \n\n\n \nRepublican\n \n\n\n \n10,124\n \n\n \nNo Party\n \n\n\n \n8,474\n \n\n \nDemocratic\n \n\n\n \n6,592\n \n\n \nOther\n \n\n\n \n175\n \n\n \n \n \nTotal Registered Voters: 25,365\n \n Register to Vote\n \n \n\n\n\n\nThis webpage was printed on October 17, 2026. For the most current election-related information, visit the Jasper County, Iowa, Elections website at jaspercountyelections.iowa.gov.\n\n\n \n\n Jasper County Auditor\n\n Jasper County Courthouse\n \n101 1st Street N, Rooms 201 & 202\n \nP.O. Box 944\n \nNewton, IA 50208\n\n Contact Us\n\n Accessibility\n\n Jasper County Website\n \n \nOffice Hours\n\n Monday - Friday\n \n8 a.m. - 4:30 p.m. \n \nPhone Numbers\n\n Office: (641) 792-7016\n \nFax: (641) 792-1053 \n \n\n \n\n Facebook Contact Us\n \n\n \n\n \n \n\n\n\n\n \npowered by \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"
